  "description": "APPLICATION FOR VARIATION OF CONDITION 2 (APPROVED PLANS) AND 3 (MATERIALS), ATTACHED TO LBM PLANNING APPLICATION 23/P2451 RELATING TO THE EXTENSIONS AT GROUND AND SECOND FLOOR LEVELS TO EXISTING DWELLING WITH NEW GARDEN STUDIO / WORKSHOP. CHANGES RELATE TO MINOR CHANGES TO THE PLANS AT GROUND AND FIRST FLOORS INC. A NEW BAY WINDOW TO THE REAR ELEVATION AT GROUND FLOOR LEVEL, TO EXTEND THE ACCOMMODATION AT SECOND FLOOR OVER THE APPROVED TERRACE AREAS ON THE SOUTH AND WEST FACES, ALTER THE APPROVED STAIR TOWER, REMOVING THE GLASS BLOCKS AND REPLACING THESE WITH A SLOT WINDOW WITH A RENDER FINISH. ALSO LOOKINGTO AGREE DETAILS FOR WINDOWS, DOORS AND GREEN ROOFS. ",
